# kind | name | source (on-disk LICENSE path for shards; SPDX id for clib/runtime)
# The clib entries are what the static Linux build links (see Dockerfile).
# zlib comes with baked_file_system's gzip storage. OpenSSL is absent on
# purpose: only the compile-time loader links it, the shipped binary does not.
shard   | baked_file_system | lib/baked_file_system/LICENSE
clib    | pcre2             | BSD-3-Clause
clib    | libyaml           | MIT
clib    | zlib              | Zlib
clib    | boehm-gc          | Boehm-GC
clib    | musl              | MIT
clib    | libgcc            | GCC-runtime-exception
runtime | crystal           | Apache-2.0
project | mcpctl            | LICENSE
